       are only reached when a caller pre-registers an OsqpQpSolver in the solver
       registry; the test forces MasonrySolverRegistry.Default = null so the
       deterministic managed lane (LS-first KKT + ADMM) runs on the CI runner. The
       mesh contact detector chain (MeshContactDetector + MeshSnapshot/Bvh/Grid +
